@startuml SEQ_06_VERIFIKASI_EMAIL
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-06: Verifikasi Email

actor       "Pengguna"                                as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"                                 as Browser
control     "EmailVerificationPromptController"       as CtrlPrompt
control     "EmailVerificationNotificationController" as CtrlNotif
control     "VerifyEmailController"                   as CtrlVerify
entity      "User Model"                              as Model
collections "Mail"                                    as Mail

== Lihat Halaman Notice Verifikasi ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Akses halaman yang membutuhkan verifikasi email

Browser  -> CtrlPrompt : GET /verify-email
CtrlPrompt --> Browser : Render halaman verifikasi email
Browser  --> Pengguna  : Tampil halaman verifikasi + tombol kirim ulang

== Kirim Ulang Email Verifikasi ==

Pengguna -> Browser   : Klik "Kirim Ulang Email Verifikasi"

Browser  -> CtrlNotif : POST /email/verification-notification

CtrlNotif -> Model    : sendEmailVerificationNotification()
Model --> CtrlNotif : Hasil query
Model -> Mail         : Kirim ulang email verifikasi
Mail --> Pengguna     : Email verifikasi dikirim ke inbox
CtrlNotif --> Browser : Tampil pesan link verifikasi telah dikirim ulang
Browser --> Pengguna  : Tampil pesan sukses

== Verifikasi Email via Link ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Klik link verifikasi di email

Browser  -> CtrlVerify : GET /verify-email/{id}/{hash}

CtrlVerify -> Model    : markEmailAsVerified()
Model --> CtrlVerify   : Berhasil
CtrlVerify --> Browser : Redirect ke Dashboard
Browser --> Pengguna   : Masuk Dashboard + notifikasi email berhasil diverifikasi

@enduml